<title>USA: Community Bankshares sets stock split.</title>
<headline>Community Bankshares sets stock split.</headline>
<dateline>ORANGEBURG, S.C. 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Community Bankshares Inc said its board has approved a two-for-one split of its common stock.</p>
<p>The split is effective on July 2 and is payable on July 21, the bank holding company said.</p>
<p>Community Bankshares, parent of Orangeburg National Bank and Sumter Natioal Bank currently has 1.3 million common shares outstanding.</p>
